# Engine incremental builds and patches

Before any incremental `make` in `build64`, editing Wine sources under
`build/**/sources/wine`, adding/updating `patches/*.patch`, or packing an
engine artifact:

1. Read `docs/incremental-build-and-patches.md`.
2. Read `patches/README.md` for apply order.
3. Follow `AGENTS.md` non-negotiables (minOS 10.15, CX26-only wineserver/frame-walk patches, pack gates).

Do not run host `clang`/`make` without `source scripts/env-x86_64.sh` (or
equivalent `MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET` + `-mmacosx-version-min`). Prefer
`scripts/rebuild-wine-host-unix.sh` when repairing minOS drift.
